From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] [unit] Add SIM card status transaction test

Runs the SIM status transaction of binder_sim_card.c against a fake
radio and checks when the slot's request group gets unblocked: no
card, a card with an active USIM app, a USIM app that has to be
subscribed first (the group must stay blocked meanwhile), and an
eUICC with no enabled profile, before and after a profile shows up.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 unit/Makefile                      |   1 +
 unit/unit_sim_card/Makefile        |   7 +
 unit/unit_sim_card/unit_sim_card.c | 589 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 597 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 unit/unit_sim_card/Makefile
 create mode 100644 unit/unit_sim_card/unit_sim_card.c

diff --git a/unit/Makefile b/unit/Makefile
index 7a8aa99..c181034 100644
